# Common Catalyst error counter table variants.
Value Required PORT (\S+)
Value ALIGN_ERR (\d+)
Value FCS_ERR (\d+)
Value XMIT_ERR (\d+)
Value RCV_ERR (\d+)
Value UNDERSIZE (\d+)
Value OUTDISCARDS (\d+)

Start
  ^\s*${PORT}\s+${ALIGN_ERR}\s+${FCS_ERR}\s+${XMIT_ERR}\s+${RCV_ERR}\s+${UNDERSIZE}\s+${OUTDISCARDS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${PORT}\s+${ALIGN_ERR}\s+${FCS_ERR}\s+${XMIT_ERR}\s+${RCV_ERR}\s*$$ -> Record
